(7352620, 1150259, 138630, '<td valign="top">Is the perspective distortion part of the effect?  I find it grating rather than enhancing . . . Love the shot and processing, though</td>', 'Is the perspective distortion part of the effect?  I find it grating rather than enhancing . . . Love the shot and processing, though', '2015-05-23 00:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
