(7352715, 1150452, 30982, '<td valign="top">Is she the one who gave us the finger recently?  She has that same swagger.  (Can''t remember the challenge or I''d go look.)  I like the filmic effects on this one.</td>', 'Is she the one who gave us the finger recently?  She has that same swagger.  (Can''t remember the challenge or I''d go look.)  I like the filmic effects on this one.', '2015-05-24 01:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
