(7352773, 1150463, 30982, '<td valign="top">Intriguing stories thorughout - I especially like the young man''s bright-eyed avoidance of the couple against the wall. And I see there are still a lot of smokers in the midwest.  Not so many out here anymore.</td>', 'Intriguing stories thorughout - I especially like the young man''s bright-eyed avoidance of the couple against the wall. And I see there are still a lot of smokers in the midwest.  Not so many out here anymore.', '2015-05-24 13:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352774, 1150433, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot - perhaps a strange question, but what lens?  I really like the photographic connection between the two people - they seem worlds apart yet you put them both in your picture.  A rare 10 from me.</td>', 'Awesome shot - perhaps a strange question, but what lens?  I really like the photographic connection between the two people - they seem worlds apart yet you put them both in your picture.  A rare 10 from me.', '2015-05-24 13:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
