(7353043, 1150110, 100393, '<td valign="top">Excellent nude and I really like the wet plate look. Perhaps the eye is slight too contrasty to really convince? I''d really love to work with wet plate collodion, that mixture of pin sharp where it matters and gorgeous fall off of focus is what I aspire to in much of my work.</td>', 'Excellent nude and I really like the wet plate look. Perhaps the eye is slight too contrasty to really convince? I''d really love to work with wet plate collodion, that mixture of pin sharp where it matters and gorgeous fall off of focus is what I aspire to in much of my work.', '2015-05-25 07:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
