(7354184, 1150344, 100393, '<td valign="top">Works for me - you could have pulled the green back and still maintained a filmic look but actually I like how this has the feel of a print left out in the sun and how that echoes the sunny feel of the image (which I find to be perfectly composed). Bumping.</td>', 'Works for me - you could have pulled the green back and still maintained a filmic look but actually I like how this has the feel of a print left out in the sun and how that echoes the sunny feel of the image (which I find to be perfectly composed). Bumping.', '2015-05-27 16:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
