(7354706, 1150179, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a nice looking scene but the super heavy dose of burn isn''t helping it.<br/> <br/>I get the purpose, but I just don''t think it''s come off well.</td>', 'This is a nice looking scene but the super heavy dose of burn isn''t helping it. I get the purpose, but I just don''t think it''s come off well.', '2015-05-28 18:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354707, 1150261, 101117, '<td valign="top">That''s going to be murder when the wind picks up!</td>', 'That''s going to be murder when the wind picks up!', '2015-05-28 18:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354708, 1150443, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is nice and exactly the effect I was expecting from this challenge. I think a slight change in framing and I would have liked this a lot more.</td>', 'This is nice and exactly the effect I was expecting from this challenge. I think a slight change in framing and I would have liked this a lot more.', '2015-05-28 18:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354710, 1150227, 101117, '<td valign="top">I know this could be a million places but it really reminds me of where I grew up in Scotland. Not that I grew up in the middle of the country, but the hills in the background are much like those I was so used to seeing.<br/> <br/>As such I think I have a natural fondness towards the photo.</td>', 'I know this could be a million places but it really reminds me of where I grew up in Scotland. Not that I grew up in the middle of the country, but the hills in the background are much like those I was so used to seeing. As such I think I have a natural fondness towards the photo.', '2015-05-28 18:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354711, 1150425, 101117, '<td valign="top">Bit heavy on the vignette has made it look more like tunnel vision than filmic.</td>', 'Bit heavy on the vignette has made it look more like tunnel vision than filmic.', '2015-05-28 18:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354712, 1150050, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is really nice, very much my kind of shot. I''m drawn to the right hand painting (photo?) on the wall which seems to be smirking in a knowing way at the whole scene.</td>', 'This is really nice, very much my kind of shot. I''m drawn to the right hand painting (photo?) on the wall which seems to be smirking in a knowing way at the whole scene.', '2015-05-28 18:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354713, 1150383, 101117, '<td valign="top">This for me is close to being very good, but is let down by the fact that the girl is a secondary feature next to the circular hole in the wall. I think a simple edit to place a touch more emphasis on the girl could have made a huge difference to this shot.<br/> <br/>Other than that, I really like it, it''s one of those that makes me wonder what she''s doing, where she''s going with such focus.</td>', 'This for me is close to being very good, but is let down by the fact that the girl is a secondary feature next to the circular hole in the wall. I think a simple edit to place a touch more emphasis on the girl could have made a huge difference to this shot. Other than that, I really like it, it''s one of those that makes me wonder what she''s doing, where she''s going with such focus.', '2015-05-28 18:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354715, 1150422, 101117, '<td valign="top">Feels more like "dreamy" than "filmic". Not that that''s a bad thing, especially given that I''m not voting and just admiring, and there''s a lot to like about this.</td>', 'Feels more like "dreamy" than "filmic". Not that that''s a bad thing, especially given that I''m not voting and just admiring, and there''s a lot to like about this.', '2015-05-28 18:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354716, 1150469, 101117, '<td valign="top">Kinda like this, there''s a story attached, something going on, makes me want to know their intent, which looks like it may be something sinister!<br/> <br/>In reality I''m sure it''s just three guys walking down the street but you''ve captured and presented it in a way that makes it a whole lot more.</td>', 'Kinda like this, there''s a story attached, something going on, makes me want to know their intent, which looks like it may be something sinister! In reality I''m sure it''s just three guys walking down the street but you''ve captured and presented it in a way that makes it a whole lot more.', '2015-05-28 18:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354756, 1150429, 119419, '<td valign="top">I like the dream state quality, two worlds collide. Nice work.</td>', 'I like the dream state quality, two worlds collide. Nice work.', '2015-05-28 21:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354757, 1150407, 119419, '<td valign="top">Painterly and zen like</td>', 'Painterly and zen like', '2015-05-28 21:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354758, 1150050, 119419, '<td valign="top">I think the red chair makes this along with the expressions, the chair being so intrusive but fitting.</td>', 'I think the red chair makes this along with the expressions, the chair being so intrusive but fitting.', '2015-05-28 21:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354759, 1150470, 119419, '<td valign="top">The step ladder is a nice addition, great faded tone.</td>', 'The step ladder is a nice addition, great faded tone.', '2015-05-28 21:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354761, 1150422, 119419, '<td valign="top">Nice eye - flower contact moment</td>', 'Nice eye - flower contact moment', '2015-05-28 21:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354762, 1150424, 119419, '<td valign="top">Definitely the right toning.</td>', 'Definitely the right toning.', '2015-05-28 21:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354763, 1150290, 119419, '<td valign="top">amazing perspective</td>', 'amazing perspective', '2015-05-28 21:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354764, 1150435, 119419, '<td valign="top">very filmic reproduction</td>', 'very filmic reproduction', '2015-05-28 21:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354765, 1150443, 119419, '<td valign="top">looks like the Phase One is working the scene ;) very nice depth and softness.</td>', 'looks like the Phase One is working the scene ;) very nice depth and softness.', '2015-05-28 21:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354766, 1150465, 119419, '<td valign="top">very appealing grain and contrast</td>', 'very appealing grain and contrast', '2015-05-28 21:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354767, 1150110, 119419, '<td valign="top">Lucky she''s in a warm climate. Nice wet plate rendition. Well done.</td>', 'Lucky she''s in a warm climate. Nice wet plate rendition. Well done.', '2015-05-28 21:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354768, 1150427, 119419, '<td valign="top">One of the few that combine the brief with concept. Nicely done.</td>', 'One of the few that combine the brief with concept. Nicely done.', '2015-05-28 21:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354769, 1150099, 119419, '<td valign="top">Moody, WA?</td>', 'Moody, WA?', '2015-05-28 21:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354770, 1150344, 119419, '<td valign="top">Lovely, filmic from the 60''s</td>', 'Lovely, filmic from the 60''s', '2015-05-28 21:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354771, 1150383, 119419, '<td valign="top">Good use of the overlay, and an interesting composition.</td>', 'Good use of the overlay, and an interesting composition.', '2015-05-28 21:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354772, 1150469, 119419, '<td valign="top">I like the stretched effect, an ordinary scene turned into one of interest.</td>', 'I like the stretched effect, an ordinary scene turned into one of interest.', '2015-05-28 21:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354773, 1150367, 119419, '<td valign="top">classic nostalgia</td>', 'classic nostalgia', '2015-05-28 21:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354774, 1150456, 119419, '<td valign="top">Very enjoyable, woofy in the woods. Almost like a cave painting.</td>', 'Very enjoyable, woofy in the woods. Almost like a cave painting.', '2015-05-28 21:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354775, 1150210, 119419, '<td valign="top">A beauty!</td>', 'A beauty!', '2015-05-28 21:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354776, 1150433, 119419, '<td valign="top">Great moment</td>', 'Great moment', '2015-05-28 21:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354777, 1150410, 119419, '<td valign="top">cool, all the right ingredients.</td>', 'cool, all the right ingredients.', '2015-05-28 21:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354791, 1150448, 94815, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. Like the shot but my many thousands of old film never looked like this even on a bad day. Looks like it was dropped in a dpc overlay whirlpool.</td>', 'Hmmm. Like the shot but my many thousands of old film never looked like this even on a bad day. Looks like it was dropped in a dpc overlay whirlpool.', '2015-05-28 22:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354792, 1150458, 94815, '<td valign="top">Kinda like the shot except for the overlay. Looks like the same overlay as the last entry. My many thousands of old film never looked like this even on a bad day.</td>', 'Kinda like the shot except for the overlay. Looks like the same overlay as the last entry. My many thousands of old film never looked like this even on a bad day.', '2015-05-28 22:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354796, 1150202, 94815, '<td valign="top">I like this shot for its unpretentious depiction of what most of us never see. Maybe a bit too grainy for old film but whatever.</td>', 'I like this shot for its unpretentious depiction of what most of us never see. Maybe a bit too grainy for old film but whatever.', '2015-05-28 22:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354812, 1150470, 138630, '<td valign="top">LOL on the title</td>', 'LOL on the title', '2015-05-28 23:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354817, 1150448, 50864, '<td valign="top">Love all of those wires. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Love all of those wires. One of my favorites.', '2015-05-28 23:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354818, 1150050, 138630, '<td valign="top">I love the guy with the newspaper . . . I''d lose the left side, though.</td>', 'I love the guy with the newspaper . . . I''d lose the left side, though.', '2015-05-28 23:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354820, 1150261, 94815, '<td valign="top">I remember guys like this back in Saigon in the ''60s but the hedges weren''t so nicely trimmed. Still like the shot.</td>', 'I remember guys like this back in Saigon in the ''60s but the hedges weren''t so nicely trimmed. Still like the shot.', '2015-05-28 23:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354822, 1150463, 94815, '<td valign="top">This cries out for a tighter crop to give the figures substantially more presence. All the extra space as is simply dilutes it all. Still a very nice slice of daily street life.</td>', 'This cries out for a tighter crop to give the figures substantially more presence. All the extra space as is simply dilutes it all. Still a very nice slice of daily street life.', '2015-05-28 23:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354825, 1150110, 94815, '<td valign="top">Nice shot at a 19th century look of deterioration and and an appropriate subject with one reservation: the subject is perhaps a bit too sophisticated and the pose too knowing, which is to say that it rises above the obviously prurient intent of those earlier photos. The face and hair interaction are, however,  exceptionally enticing - maybe it is prurient after all.</td>', 'Nice shot at a 19th century look of deterioration and and an appropriate subject with one reservation: the subject is perhaps a bit too sophisticated and the pose too knowing, which is to say that it rises above the obviously prurient intent of those earlier photos. The face and hair interaction are, however,  exceptionally enticing - maybe it is prurient after all.', '2015-05-29 00:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354827, 1150384, 94815, '<td valign="top">Such a lovely interruption of the pilings repetition and reflection. The bits of color provided by the beach toys are like bits of icing on the cake. bump</td>', 'Such a lovely interruption of the pilings repetition and reflection. The bits of color provided by the beach toys are like bits of icing on the cake. bump', '2015-05-29 00:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354828, 1150290, 94815, '<td valign="top">Yes! I was wondering if someone in the right place would put up a shot in the old view camera style a la Ansel Adams et al. And so it is. Nice. and a late hour bump</td>', 'Yes! I was wondering if someone in the right place would put up a shot in the old view camera style a la Ansel Adams et al. And so it is. Nice. and a late hour bump', '2015-05-29 00:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354829, 1150066, 94815, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot for its composition and atmospheric tonality. But how does a colored bit of flare get into a black &amp; white film image???? Imaginative. And a late bump.</td>', 'I like this image a lot for its composition and atmospheric tonality. But how does a colored bit of flare get into a black & white film image???? Imaginative. And a late bump.', '2015-05-29 00:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354831, 1150456, 94815, '<td valign="top">Hard to know what one say coherently except to go from the gut, which is: I like the shot''s textures and visual integration of the recognizable shape of the dog into its vitally abstract environment.</td>', 'Hard to know what one say coherently except to go from the gut, which is: I like the shot''s textures and visual integration of the recognizable shape of the dog into its vitally abstract environment.', '2015-05-29 00:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354833, 1150452, 94815, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific shot. The attitude and posture of the child are so natural and sociologically poignent - reminds me almost of Dorothea Lange''s dust bowel photographs. But the aspect ratio is unnatural and unfilmic in my view and the scratchy overlay an unnecessary distraction from an otherwise winning shot. Scratches in my film never looked like that.</td>', 'This is a terrific shot. The attitude and posture of the child are so natural and sociologically poignent - reminds me almost of Dorothea Lange''s dust bowel photographs. But the aspect ratio is unnatural and unfilmic in my view and the scratchy overlay an unnecessary distraction from an otherwise winning shot. Scratches in my film never looked like that.', '2015-05-29 00:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354835, 1150224, 177838, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t get too close to this guy.</td>', 'I wouldn''t get too close to this guy.', '2015-05-29 00:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354836, 1150410, 177838, '<td valign="top">There''s one missing! ;)</td>', 'There''s one missing! ;)', '2015-05-29 00:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354837, 1150452, 177838, '<td valign="top">Nice misfit</td>', 'Nice misfit', '2015-05-29 00:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354838, 1150424, 94815, '<td valign="top">She looks familiar but nevermind. The shot still has a refreshingly spontaneous quality of high contrast film push-processed in my darkroom. Only the vignette seems unfilmlike. voted earlier</td>', 'She looks familiar but nevermind. The shot still has a refreshingly spontaneous quality of high contrast film push-processed in my darkroom. Only the vignette seems unfilmlike. voted earlier', '2015-05-29 00:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354839, 1150424, 177838, '<td valign="top">This gal''s got attitude!</td>', 'This gal''s got attitude!', '2015-05-29 00:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
