(7355153, 1150110, 16106, '<td valign="top">It''s funny, while I liked your shot for the Joel challenge, it seemed....incomplete somehow. Then I saw this and it all made sense. This is it. Whole and complete. The softness of the editing treatment, and that razor sharpness of the right eye, yup,yup,yup. My highest rated shot in quite some time.</td>', 'It''s funny, while I liked your shot for the Joel challenge, it seemed....incomplete somehow. Then I saw this and it all made sense. This is it. Whole and complete. The softness of the editing treatment, and that razor sharpness of the right eye, yup,yup,yup. My highest rated shot in quite some time.', '2015-05-29 16:42:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7355158, 1150443, 16106, '<td valign="top">It is rare when the title, the model, the lighting, and the editing are all in perfect accord. Full marks.</td>', 'It is rare when the title, the model, the lighting, and the editing are all in perfect accord. Full marks.', '2015-05-29 16:47:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7355162, 1150429, 16106, '<td valign="top">I often like to comment on the image that placed lowest among my top picks. and that dubious honor is yours. Here is an image that returns dividends to the careful eye. There are layers upon layers here. I''m not surprised that it fell as far as it did because it is not simple and does not give rewards to the 3 second glance, nor am I surprised by those who have commented before me in praise of this image. These are the lovers of the poetic image,those who drink deep at the fount of photographic art and the people who you must turn your back on if our team has any chance in the DPL ;) Enough with the art, we need to move product.</td>', 'I often like to comment on the image that placed lowest among my top picks. and that dubious honor is yours. Here is an image that returns dividends to the careful eye. There are layers upon layers here. I''m not surprised that it fell as far as it did because it is not simple and does not give rewards to the 3 second glance, nor am I surprised by those who have commented before me in praise of this image. These are the lovers of the poetic image,those who drink deep at the fount of photographic art and the people who you must turn your back on if our team has any chance in the DPL ;) Enough with the art, we need to move product.', '2015-05-29 16:59:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7355190, 1150424, 40391, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe this is your first ribbon. This is a great image and congrats.</td>', 'I can''t believe this is your first ribbon. This is a great image and congrats.', '2015-05-29 18:48:04.000000', NULL, 0),
